<node id="Written Notice">
  <data key="d0">Written Notice</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A written notice is a document that must be delivered to the borrower informing them of any charges, fees, or insurance requirements associated with their loan.&lt;SEP&gt;A written notice is a formal communication sent by the servicer to the borrower, detailing required actions or information regarding hazard insurance coverage.&lt;SEP&gt;Written Notice is a formal communication that the servicer must provide to the borrower regarding insurance requirements and other loan-related matters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e7f1720b60b150596557d5a7cfcb1f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08b7ae1492b3de4d1e4389da5a03ea08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7a5f1a5e29a35b6e3bade16181f31a5</data>
