<node id="United States">
  <data key="d0">United States</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">The United States is a country in North America, serving as the governing body behind the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is a country located in North America. It serves as the administrative foundation for the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau (CFPB), which is situated within its borders. The CFPB operates in the United States, providing oversight and regulations for financial systems to ensure consumer protection. This entity plays a critical role in the governance of financial practices in the country.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the country where the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau is located and operates.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the country where the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau is located and operates.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cb57ef591f5c6bce5a3a8405291b5f27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04812c79c1582fb7095dc2e3b192fa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-728d4db6e62d4fda79187b89fc62841e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25c602269240ff304f98a696cdcd7ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5722058b331687d6a28555128bfb3be</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
</node>
<node id="Money Topics">
  <data key="d0">Money Topics</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Money Topics comprise various financial categories including Auto Loans, Mortgages, Credit Cards, etc., aimed at educating consumers on financial matters.&lt;SEP&gt;Money Topics comprise various financial categories including Auto Loans, Mortgages, Credit Cards, etc., aimed at educating consumers on financial matters.&lt;SEP&gt;Money Topics comprise various financial categories including Auto Loans, Mortgages, Credit Cards, etc., aimed at educating consumers on financial matters.&lt;SEP&gt;Money Topics refer to various financial subjects covered by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau, including loans, credit cards, and mortgages.&lt;SEP&gt;Money Topics refer to various financial subjects covered by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau, including loans, credit cards, and mortgages.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-728d4db6e62d4fda79187b89fc62841e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5722058b331687d6a28555128bfb3be</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
</node>
<node id="Consumer Complaint Database">
  <data key="d0">Consumer Complaint Database</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Consumer Complaint Database is a resource provided by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau for consumers to lodge complaints regarding financial products and services.&lt;SEP&gt;The Consumer Complaint Database is a valuable resource offered by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau (CFPB) that enables consumers to lodge complaints related to financial products and services. This database not only allows consumers to submit their complaints but also provides them with the opportunity to view trends in consumer issues. By facilitating access to these complaints against financial institutions, the Consumer Complaint Database promotes transparency and accountability within the financial sector.</data>
