  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Data &amp; Research encompasses various resources and reports produced by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau to analyze consumer trends and market conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Data &amp; Research encompasses various resources and reports produced by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau to analyze consumer trends and market conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Data &amp; Research involves the collection and analysis of financial data to inform policy decisions and monitor consumer protection efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Data &amp; Research involves the collection and analysis of financial data to inform policy decisions and monitor consumer protection efforts.</data>
