  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Consumer Complaint Program, an initiative by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau, enables individuals to submit grievances concerning financial institutions. This program is designed to ensure that consumer issues related to financial products and services are effectively addressed and resolved. It facilitates the collection and resolution of complaints from consumers, allowing them to report their concerns and seek recourse against financial entities.</data>
