<node id="Mortgage Servicing">
  <data key="d0">Mortgage Servicing</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Mortgage Servicing refers to the comprehensive process of managing a borrower's mortgage loan. This includes, but is not limited to, collecting payments, handling escrow accounts, and managing borrower inquiries. It encompasses the administrative aspects necessary for overseeing mortgage accounts effectively, ensuring that all financial transactions are recorded and managed appropriately. Ultimately, mortgage servicing plays a crucial role in the overall maintenance and administration of mortgage loans.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-df38a08194da67325630df5024565b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5037dbd90358cc97b80584a3114e27be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daec882166d08546d8f3b9c5cd1cddab</data>
