  <data key="d2">Comment for 1024.36 describes the requirements for responding to borrowers' information requests.&lt;SEP&gt;Comment for 1024.36 describes the requirements for responding to borrowers' information requests.&lt;SEP&gt;This comment explains the requirements surrounding borrowers' rights to request information from mortgage servicers.&lt;SEP&gt;This comment explains the requirements surrounding borrowers' rights to request information from mortgage servicers.</data>
