  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Comment for 1024.40 mandates mortgage servicers to maintain continuity of contact with borrowers.&lt;SEP&gt;Comment for 1024.40 mandates mortgage servicers to maintain continuity of contact with borrowers.&lt;SEP&gt;This comment dictates the requirements for continuity of contact for borrowers during the servicing process.&lt;SEP&gt;This comment dictates the requirements for continuity of contact for borrowers during the servicing process.</data>
