  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A Bankruptcy Case is a legal proceeding involving a consumer declaring bankruptcy, affecting their financial obligations and rights regarding existing debts.&lt;SEP&gt;A bankruptcy case is a legal proceeding involving a person or business that is unable to repay outstanding debts and seeks relief through the bankruptcy process.</data>
