<edge source="Regulation X" target="RESPA">
  <data key="d5">32.0</data>
  <data key="d6">Regulation X enforces the provisions of RESPA, particularly concerning settlement services in federally related mortgage loans.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation X is a part of the broader legal framework established by RESPA, focusing on settlement procedures and disclosures in real estate transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation X is established under RESPA to provide guidelines and requirements for mortgage servicing and settlement procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation X is established under RESPA to provide guidelines and requirements for mortgage servicing and settlement procedures.</data>
