<edge source="Regulation X" target="Consumer Financial Protection Bureau">
  <data key="d5">37.0</data>
  <data key="d6">Regulation X is enforced by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau to protect consumers in mortgage transactions regarding insurance requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation X is formulated and enforced by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau which governs certain financial practices.&lt;SEP&gt;The Consumer Financial Protection Bureau is responsible for overseeing and enforcing Regulation X and its provisions on electronic disclosures.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation X is enforced by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau, which oversees compliance within mortgage transactions.</data>
