<edge source="Borrower" target="Servicer">
  <data key="d5">93.0</data>
  <data key="d6">The Servicer plays a vital role in managing the escrow account for the Borrower, ensuring that all payments related to taxes and insurance are appropriately handled in accordance with the mortgage contract. This management includes providing essential account statements, monitoring compliance with applicable regulations, and analyzing payments to ensure they align with mortgage terms. The Borrower engages with the Servicer for comprehensive loan management, which encompasses making payments and addressing any issues related to the escrow account.

Furthermore, the Servicer is responsible for ensuring that hazard insurance premiums are paid in a timely manner to protect the Borrower's interests. The relationship between the Borrower and the Servicer is crucial for effective mortgage management and compliance.

Additionally, the Servicer communicates directly with the Borrower regarding insurance requirements, including estimates for insurance costs and details about force-placed insurance when necessary. This includes informing the Borrower about their insurance obligations and any associated fees for insurance that may be mandated under the terms of the mortgage loan contract. Overall, the Servicer's comprehensive management of the Borrower's mortgage not only assists in maintaining compliance but also addresses any concerns related to insurance, thereby enhancing the protection of the Borrower's investment.</data>
  <data key="d7">financial management, borrower servicing&lt;SEP&gt;financial management, client relationship&lt;SEP&gt;financial management, payment responsibility&lt;SEP&gt;financial relationship, obligation&lt;SEP&gt;interaction, loan management&lt;SEP&gt;lending relationship, loan management&lt;SEP&gt;loan management, insurance compliance&lt;SEP&gt;management, accountability&lt;SEP&gt;management, mortgage servicing&lt;SEP&gt;mortgage management, financial responsibility&lt;SEP&gt;mortgage management, insurance communication</data>
  <data key="d8">chunk-6ced7ff70f91acdf5c961917eb870aac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5970643bcc88ac39d8eb217b0396721e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6d5b3e293d8f6d23e9f3516bd0a5c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e7f1720b60b150596557d5a7cfcb1f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4523fa52055965ffd8fb7c7a1badd8bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7a5f1a5e29a35b6e3bade16181f31a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86c2bd8ff165a9031d24150a1f7343b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa3e0fe9b23de062547a80ba268a3fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4b7f842be5454c673ef5f1ef2059435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08b7ae1492b3de4d1e4389da5a03ea08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d168fa7f9f5adeb00ca45ff65bf3fad4</data>
  <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
</edge>
