  <data key="d6">Servicers need to ensure that borrowers maintain hazard insurance in accordance with loan contracts to protect the property’s value.&lt;SEP&gt;The servicer may charge the borrower for force-placed hazard insurance if the borrower fails to provide adequate evidence of coverage.</data>
