<edge source="Consumer Financial Protection Bureau" target="United States">
  <data key="d5">79.0</data>
  <data key="d6">The Consumer Financial Protection Bureau (CFPB) is a federal government agency operating under the jurisdiction of the United States. It is located within the United States and functions to serve consumers in financial matters. The CFPB operates within the legal framework established by the United States government, emphasizing its role as a key entity in protecting consumer rights and promoting fair financial practices.&lt;SEP&gt;The Consumer Financial Protection Bureau is a U.S. government agency operating under the jurisdiction of the United States.".&lt;SEP&gt;The Consumer Financial Protection Bureau is a government agency operating within the jurisdiction of the United States.</data>
  <data key="d7">agency location, government&lt;SEP&gt;government agency, jurisdiction&lt;SEP&gt;government agency, national jurisdiction</data>
  <data key="d8">chunk-cb57ef591f5c6bce5a3a8405291b5f27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d04812c79c1582fb7095dc2e3b192fa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-728d4db6e62d4fda79187b89fc62841e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25c602269240ff304f98a696cdcd7ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5722058b331687d6a28555128bfb3be</data>
  <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
</edge>
